":32359664,"digest":"sha256:da06f0031c1fbf75efdff46b9328ecfd186fc3d7dcb2ab92d4c66d337d7093e8","download_count":769,"created_at":"2026-10-24T20:02:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:02:19Z"},{"id":673253966,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oIQpO","name":"DBX_0.6.54_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":186084528,"digest":"sha256:4ced1d06dcaf46bf04170ac677a3c3f609f401744edc58333ece8a263672e660","download_count":35,"created_at":"2026-10-24T20:37:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:38:02Z"},{"id":673253969,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oIQpR","name":"DBX_0.6.54_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:d816e8723bb0c0fe717c1a5ce415703a144e488f80aa7fad24d80a68deb0c567","download_count":11,"created_at":"2026-10-24T20:37:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:37:56Z"},{"id":673224347,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oIJab","name":"DBX_0.6.54_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":46897866,"digest":"sha256:033b3c07e7042595d74b0b1b1e8105d6769c4ab30910c213263a7489ba7976ab","download_count":47,"created_at":"2026-10-24T20:24:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:24:08Z"},{"id":673180372,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oH-rU","name":"DBX_0.6.54_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":42020864,"digest":"sha256:d4a866a0088265d182d106d666aaf031bb1b83240013a46b7a98b17a0656056e","download_count":35,"created_at":"2026-10-24T20:02:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:02:17Z"},{"id":673224504,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oIJc4","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":46914970,"digest":"sha256:b13ae80837a5ef042b80782d0c0877d301946823f5ad82e8ca43affb4ae8c3a6","download_count":62,"created_at":"2026-10-24T20:24:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:24:10Z"},{"id":673271023,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oIUzv","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":16646,"digest":"sha256:4345ab1c48714f1e92a967bd0abd65630499819cba3c8ea3de94e48dcd964ad4","download_count":6483,"created_at":"2026-10-24T20:46:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T20:46:55Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- Oracle / OceanBase Oracle 的 DDL 查看与复制统一为「紧凑 SQL」「存储属性」「独立索引」三种选项，并可单独查看索引 DDL (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13386](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13386))\n- Oracle / OceanBase Oracle 结构比较支持 PACKAGE 与 PACKAGE BODY 的规格、包体受控比较与迁移，含依赖顺序、编译错误与执行后的读回校验 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13326](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13326))\n- Redis 危险操作确认框改为提供可直接执行的命令，按原始字节保真转义，集群下按哈希槽分批执行，不再只是文字说明 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12917](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12917))\n- Kafka 消息浏览器新增从指定时间开始读取，按分区时间戳定位起始偏移 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12501](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12501))\n- 消息队列支持解析 Thrift 二进制消息体并展示为可读字段 (contributed by @colabhoangbui2110) (PR [#13318](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13318))\n- openGauss 支持执行计划按钮，使用纯文本 EXPLAIN 构建计划树 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13342](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13342))\n- 数据表格选区统计新增最小值、最大值与去重计数 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13339](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13339))\n- TSV 复制支持与 CSV 一致的公式转义、表头位置等选项，并支持名称与描述两行表头 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13346](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13346))\n- SQL 占位符支持方括号写法（如 [${name}]），可在变量语法设置中单独开关 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#13378](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13378))\n- 设置中可直接调整全局连接超时与查询超时，连接失败提示处提供修改超时的快捷入口 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#13380](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13380))\n- 连接深链可选择免确认直接保存，按新建连接与带 id 的更新链接分别设置 (contributed by @javalover123) (PR [#13384](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13384))\n- SQL 编辑器右键菜单新增复制当前语句，与选中当前语句共用同一范围计算 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13338](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13338))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 结果标签栏中点击已固定的结果可直接取消固定，不必再打开右键菜单 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13337](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13337))\n- 垂直标签栏配色与顶部栏保持一致，当前标签的选中态更清晰 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13341](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13341))\n- 导入进行中的进度显示源文件名，便于确认当前处理的是哪个文件 (contributed by @caiyq925-cell) (PR [#13335](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13335))\n- 界面文字恢复使用系统原生字体渲染，不再强制灰度抗锯齿\n- 执行 SQL 文件时进度区域自动进入视野，向上滚动后不再抢回滚动位置 (contributed by @Gaiokane) (PR [#13379](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13379))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复切换结果标签导致数据表格重新挂载时，未提交的编辑内容丢失、保存状态不显示的问题\n- 修复 Doris 与 StarRocks 复合 UNIQUE KEY 表无法识别行标识、无法编辑数据的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13385](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13385))\n- 修复 Doris 与 StarRocks 的 UNIQUE KEY 列被误标为主键，导致建表语句、导出、传输和 ER 图显示错误键信息的问题\n- 修复 PostgreSQL 新建查询时跨 schema 的表未加 schema 限定、可能命中同名表的问题 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13340](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13340))\n- 修复 Greenplum 与 Cloudberry 无主键表打开数据页时报无法获取系统列的问题 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13343](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13343))\n- 修复 ClickHouse 执行 WITH ... INSERT 语句报错、写入被当作查询处理的问题 (contributed by @lcq928) (PR [#13327](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13327))\n- 修复 MySQL Preferred TLS 在服务端不支持 TLS 1.2/1.3 时未回退、连接失败且报错难以判断原因的问题 (contributed by @caichangqing1120) (PR [#13294](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13294))\n- 修复插件分组标签丢失图标和分组名的问题 (contributed by @Ezreal-byte) (PR [#13292](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13292))\n- 修复列筛选输入以 0 开头的值时被当作数字比较、文本列匹配不到结果的问题 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#13107](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13107))\n- 修复侧边栏表分组中未在当前页加载的分组成员不可见的问题 (contributed by @ordinary-s) (PR [#13331](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13331))\n- 修复 AI 智能修复 SQL 报错时上下文缺少失败语句本身的问题 (contributed by @ordinary-s) (PR [#13333](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13333))\n- 修复 Kafka 元数据超时后消费者组列表变空的问题 (contributed by @ordinary-s) (PR [#13334](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13334))\n- 修复删除连接后保留的数据与结构标签提示找不到连接配置的问题 (contributed by @javalover123) (PR [#13356](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13356))\n- 修复表结构草稿在元数据刷新失败时被丢弃的问题 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13345](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13345))\n- 修复查询返回超大结果集时传输失败且没有明确提示的问题，并对 LOB 快照改为按需读取 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13353](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13353))\n- 修复插件页签中操作系统拖拽文件时拿不到拖拽位置的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13383](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13383))\n- 修复插件工具返回值缺少 resultType 字段、新版 MCP 客户端拒绝结果的问题 (contributed by @Rendegou) (PR [#13328](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13328))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.54) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.54` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":14}
